{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24744","headline":"和河南郑尹新岁对雪 · 白居易","name":"和河南郑尹新岁对雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白雪吟诗铃阁开，故情新兴两裴回。\n昔经勤苦照书卷，今助欢娱飘酒杯。\n楚客难酬郢中曲，吴公兼占洛阳才。\n铜街金谷春知否，又有诗人作尹来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}